{"unit_id":"jiangwangyang__dsh-theme-blackhole#card-zh","repo":"jiangwangyang/dsh-theme-blackhole","commit":"05ff77b9191076eca58cb5f5bf1fbc939c42b234","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-blackhole（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH 网页版加入实时黑洞背景与深空玻璃主题。客户端通过主题服务覆盖界面令牌，并注入样式和 WebGL 渲染器。黑洞背景呈现引力透镜、吸积盘与星空，面板采用半透明深色和琥珀强调色；系统减少动态效果时显示静态画面。适合想改变 DSH 网页外观的用户。需要支持 WebGL 的浏览器并安装到 web profile；无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:721-746","src/client/index.js:660-683"]}
{"unit_id":"jiangwangyang__dsh-theme-blackhole#card-en","repo":"jiangwangyang/dsh-theme-blackhole","commit":"05ff77b9191076eca58cb5f5bf1fbc939c42b234","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-theme-blackhole themes DSH Web with a WebGL black hole background and translucent deep-space panels. It overrides theme tokens, renders lensing and an accretion disk, and adds amber accents. Reduced-motion mode shows a still frame. Requires WebGL; no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:721-746","src/client/index.js:660-683"]}
