{"unit_id":"jiangwangyang__dsh-theme-blackhole#feature-1","repo":"jiangwangyang/dsh-theme-blackhole","commit":"05ff77b9191076eca58cb5f5bf1fbc939c42b234","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-blackhole 的功能「实时黑洞背景」：在 DSH 网页界面下方以 WebGL 绘制史瓦西黑洞、吸积盘和星空，并模拟引力透镜。插件激活后自动启动渲染，生成全屏动态背景。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:265-277","src/client/index.js:660-683"]}
{"unit_id":"jiangwangyang__dsh-theme-blackhole#feature-2","repo":"jiangwangyang/dsh-theme-blackhole","commit":"05ff77b9191076eca58cb5f5bf1fbc939c42b234","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-blackhole 的功能「深空玻璃配色」：通过主题服务覆盖 DSH Web 的背景、边框、文字和交互令牌，形成半透明深色面板与琥珀色强调。插件加载时自动应用，覆盖层随卸载移除。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:34-165","src/client/index.js:724-725"]}
{"unit_id":"jiangwangyang__dsh-theme-blackhole#feature-3","repo":"jiangwangyang/dsh-theme-blackhole","commit":"05ff77b9191076eca58cb5f5bf1fbc939c42b234","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-blackhole 的功能「减少动态效果适配」：读取系统 prefers-reduced-motion 设置；启用时只绘制一帧静态黑洞画面，不启动持续动画循环。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:657-683"]}
{"unit_id":"jiangwangyang__dsh-theme-blackhole#feature-4","repo":"jiangwangyang/dsh-theme-blackhole","commit":"05ff77b9191076eca58cb5f5bf1fbc939c42b234","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-blackhole 的功能「卸载清理」：插件停止时取消动画帧、解绑缩放监听、释放 WebGL 上下文并移除画布层，同时撤下样式和主题令牌，恢复当前偏好对应的外观基调。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:690-711","src/client/index.js:748-760"]}
